<li>&lt;a href="https%3A//web.archive.org/web/20150402103455/https%3A//www.jsbi.org/pdfs/journal1/GIW99/GIW99P66.pdf"&gt;Sintésis sareng Analisis Sistem Biologis&lt;/a&gt;, ku Hiroyuki Kurata, 1999.</li>
<li>Éta tina sakedik sareng pas tina sakedik. Kana asal sareng pangaruh inpormasi dina évolusi rata-rata. Ngawengku kumaha bentuk kahirupan sareng sistem biologis asalna sareng ti saprak éta mekar janten langkung rumit, kalebet épolusi gén sareng memes, janten mémik rumit ti organisasi sareng perusahaan multinasional sareng " otak global ", (Yves Decadt, 2000). Buku anu diterbitkeun dina basa Walanda ku ringkesan kertas Inggris dina The Information Philosopher, &lt;a href="http%3A//www.informationphilosopher.com/solutions/scientists/decadt/"&gt;http://www.informationphilosopher.com/solutions/s Scientists/decadt/&lt;/a&gt;</li>
