<li>Plant List: &lt;a href="http%3A//www.theplantlist.org/tpl1.1/record/kew-286258"&gt;Pandanus kurzii Merr.&lt;/a&gt;. Diakses pada 30/X/2017.</li>
<li>JSTOR: &lt;a href="http%3A//plants.jstor.org/stable/10.5555/al.ap.specimen.k000781707"&gt;Holotype of Pandanus kurzii Merr.&lt;/a&gt; [family PANDANACEAE]. Diakses pada 30/X/2017.</li>
<li>Plant Illustration: &lt;a href="http%3A//botanicalillustrations.org/illustration.php%3Fid_illustration%3D180728%26amp%3BSID%3D0%26amp%3Bmobile%3D0%26amp%3Bcode_category_taxon%3D9%26amp%3Bsize%3D1"&gt;Pandanus kurzii Merr. (as Pandanus caricosus Kurz)&lt;/a&gt;. Diakses pada 30/X/2017.</li>
